{"3836120":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Land of Glarefall","steam_appid":3836120,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Land of Glarefall<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An action-adventure survival game where every night could be your last.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a royal investigator sent to uncover the truth behind a mysterious energy source known as &quot;<strong>Black Gold&quot;<\/strong>—and the terrifying creatures drawn to it.<br>Explore a vast, dangerous world where <strong>survival depends on smart resource management, tactical combat, and what you choose to do before night falls.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/a38157ce6d16edef60508b6b296790b3.poster.avif?t=1790295330\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/a38157ce6d16edef60508b6b296790b3.webm?t=1790295330\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/a38157ce6d16edef60508b6b296790b3.mp4?t=1790295330\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Day-Night Cycle<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daytime<\/strong> is your window to explore, gather resources, build, and push the story forward.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night<\/strong> brings relentless waves of monsters. Prepare your defenses—or be overwhelmed.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/8d24dbed41aaace2b28cd9c02542c9b6.poster.avif?t=1790295330\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/8d24dbed41aaace2b28cd9c02542c9b6.webm?t=1790295330\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/8d24dbed41aaace2b28cd9c02542c9b6.mp4?t=1790295330\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/a6f31c97193e254de89e39546568d841.poster.avif?t=1790295330\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/a6f31c97193e254de89e39546568d841.webm?t=1790295330\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/a6f31c97193e254de89e39546568d841.mp4?t=1790295330\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/2989cc8db8554ea6bc88e37da2a7e23b.poster.avif?t=1790295330\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/2989cc8db8554ea6bc88e37da2a7e23b.webm?t=1790295330\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/2989cc8db8554ea6bc88e37da2a7e23b.mp4?t=1790295330\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Survive<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest wood, ore, and other materials to craft healing items, upgrade gear, and construct powerful defensive structures.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/4eca427371b29a9f95db8ae88f0afce8.poster.avif?t=1790295330\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/4eca427371b29a9f95db8ae88f0afce8.webm?t=1790295330\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/4eca427371b29a9f95db8ae88f0afce8.mp4?t=1790295330\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero Growth &amp; Custom Skills<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from unique heroes, each with their own skill tree and progression path.<br>Tailor your build to suit your preferred combat style—whether that’s frontline aggression or tactical support.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/2fa9e217cd4915c59ca77162fcb54ab7.poster.avif?t=1790295330\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/2fa9e217cd4915c59ca77162fcb54ab7.webm?t=1790295330\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/2fa9e217cd4915c59ca77162fcb54ab7.mp4?t=1790295330\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruitable Mercenary System<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build outposts to hire and upgrade mercenaries who can support you in combat and hold the line during nightfall assaults.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/f24d13ceb75488cecefc153f88122978.poster.avif?t=1790295330\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/f24d13ceb75488cecefc153f88122978.webm?t=1790295330\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/f24d13ceb75488cecefc153f88122978.mp4?t=1790295330\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Boss Hunt Encounters<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful bosses in special large-scale map events.<br>Utilize terrain, deploy defenses, and lead mercenaries into battle—or pour all your resources into yourself and take on the boss <strong>one-on-one<\/strong> in a duel of strength and strategy.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/d3f1a558d969d7d6e30872db76619872.poster.avif?t=1790295330\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/d3f1a558d969d7d6e30872db76619872.webm?t=1790295330\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3836120\/extras\/d3f1a558d969d7d6e30872db76619872.mp4?t=1790295330\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p